{
  "_comment": "Deterministic catalyst pre-classification rules (IP-T443, IP-LAW-7). CatalystPreClassifier applies them in this order: offering forms, 8-K items, keyword rules (first match wins, in listed order), then the promo test. Phrases are matched case-insensitively against headline + summary. The gapper study recomputes these on history, so a change here changes the study: version it.",
